{"assets":["/statement-assets/80182c240e4c12b0fbca5095301668e3364c798b32a549216ac63c76e53f5f7c.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1198","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Rectangle Painting 2"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a square grid of size $$$n \\times n$$$. Some cells are colored in black, all others are colored in white. In one operation you can select some rectangle and color all its cells in white. It costs $$$\\min(h, w)$$$ to color a rectangle of size $$$h \\times w$$$. You are to make all cells white for minimum total cost."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The square is large, so we give it to you in a compressed way. The set of black cells is the union of $$$m$$$ rectangles."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^{9}$$$, $$$0 \\le m \\le 50$$$) — the size of the square grid and the number of black rectangles."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$m$$$ lines contains 4 integers $$$x_{i1}$$$ $$$y_{i1}$$$ $$$x_{i2}$$$ $$$y_{i2}$$$ ($$$1 \\le x_{i1} \\le x_{i2} \\le n$$$, $$$1 \\le y_{i1} \\le y_{i2} \\le n$$$) — the coordinates of the bottom-left and the top-right corner cells of the $$$i$$$-th black rectangle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The rectangles may intersect."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the minimum total cost of painting the whole square in white."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10 2\n4 1 5 10\n1 4 10 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 6\n2 1 2 1\n4 2 4 3\n2 5 2 5\n2 3 5 3\n1 2 1 2\n3 2 5 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The examples and some of optimal solutions are shown on the pictures below."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/80182c240e4c12b0fbca5095301668e3364c798b32a549216ac63c76e53f5f7c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1198E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1198/problem/E"}